[?2004l[?2004h> progress = """# Incident Investigation Progress Report & Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> **Incident Identifier:** INC-2024-0816-WP  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Victim Host:** wordpress-prod-01 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Attacker Origin IP:** `198.51.100.40` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Lead Analyst:** DFIR Taskforce  
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004las[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 1. Executive Summary & Context
[?2004lb [?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> On August 16, 2024, endpoint security feeds surfaced initial alerts for host `wordpress-prod-01` (`/sas/alerts.json:1-25`). Specifically, alerts covered PHP webshell execution at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` (`/sas/alerts.json:4`), site defacement at `/var/www/html/index.html` (`/sas/alerts.json:11`), and baseline weaknesses in `wp-config.php` (`/sas/alerts.json:18`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> However, forensic investigation of the disk image (`/disk`) revealed several **silent (unalerted)** post-exploitation actions and persistence mechanisms that were missed by security alerting:  
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. Scheduled crontab persistence for user `www-data` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`).  
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. Scheduled crontab persistence for user `root` (`/disk/etc/crontab:5`).  
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. Malicious `.htaccess` traffic redirection to `198.51.100.40` (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 2. Chronological Incident Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> | Timestamp (UTC) | Category | Description | Alerted vs Silent | Citation |
[?2004l[?2004h> |---|---|---|---|---|
[?2004l[?2004h> | 2026-08-09 03:11:17 | Exploitation | Webshell upload POST request to `/uploads/shell.php` | Alerted (ALERT-01) | `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/error.log:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:4` |
[?2004l[?2004h> | 2026-08-09 03:12:49 | Reconnaissance | Attacker JNDI Log4Shell probe | **Silent (Unalerted)** | `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:298` |
[?2004l[?2004h> | 2026-08-09 03:13:22 | Reconnaissance | Attacker Struts2 OGNL probe | **Silent (Unalerted)** | `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:299` |
[?2004l[?2004h> | 2026-08-09 03:15:00 | Persistence | Attacker established crontab persistence | **Silent (Unalerted)** | `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`, `/disk/etc/crontab:5` |
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 3. Working Checklist & Investigation Status
