[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Traffic Redirection (.htaccess) Inspection (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:1-2`)
[?2004l/plugins/co[?2004h> - [x] WordPress Config Audit (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:1-5`, `/sas/baseline.json:1`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Reconcile Stale Change Ticket CHG-1481 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`)
