[?2004l*[?2004h> ## 4. Reconciliation of Change Ticket CHG-1481
[?2004lh[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> The draft change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1-25` was based solely on alerts. Reconciliation against disk evidence:
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Row 1 (Source IP):** Corrected IP from `203.0.113.9` to `198.51.100.40` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Row 2 (CVE Patch):** Corrected CVE from BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) to CVE-2022-1609 (`/sas/vulns.json:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Row 3 (Root Cron):** Reconciled root crontab in `/disk/etc/crontab:5`. Status changed from DONE to OPEN.
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Row 4+ (Silent Findings Added):** Added `www-data` crontab (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`), `.htaccess` redirect (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`), webshell quarantine (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1`), and defacement removal (`/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> """
