[?2004ln[?2004h> ## 1. Primary Entry Point Analysis (CVE-2022-1609)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **CVE Identifier:** CVE-2022-1609 (`/sas/vulns.json:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`)
